Usage:
  umkim cluster platform enable-kubevirt [cluster] [flags]

Flags:
      --bridge string   Host bridge device name when --lan-bridge (default "n0p0_mgmt_nw")
      --force           Re-run install even if already Ready (LAN Multus upgrade does not need this)
  -h, --help            help for enable-kubevirt
      --keep-ip         Move management IP onto the bridge (recommended) (default true)
      --lan-bridge      Configure host Linux bridge on all nodes + Multus NAD (LAN VMs)
      --slave string    Optional physical NIC to enslave (default: NIC holding management IP)
      --wait duration   Wait for Ready (e.g. 45m); 0 = return after accept

Global Flags:
      --api-url string    Fleet API base URL (or UMKIM_API_URL)
      --auth-url string   Auth API base URL (or UMKIM_AUTH_URL)
  -o, --output string     Output format: table, wide, json (default "table")
      --token string      Service account token (or UMKIM_TOKEN)

